[TITLE:e200z4 Manual Extraction - Key Information for Certification]

[INTRO]
This document extracts key information from the e200z4 Core Reference Manual
for validation against LLVM implementation. Manual is available at:
https://www.elektronikjk.com/elementy_czynne/IC/E200Z4.pdf

MANUAL_INFO:
- Document: e200z4 Power Architecture™ Core Reference Manual
- Document Number: e200z4RM
- Revision: Rev. 0, 10/2009
- Publisher: Freescale Semiconductor (now NXP)

