CURRENT_LLVM_IMPLEMENTATION:
Code_Location: llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/PPCScheduleE200Z4.td:226-268
SPE_Instructions:
- IIC_VecGeneral: 1 cycle latency (lines 228-232)
- IIC_VecComplex: 4 cycle latency (lines 233-239)
- IIC_FPGeneral: 3 cycle latency (lines 240-247)
- IIC_FPAddSub: 4 cycle latency (lines 248-254)
