[EXTRACTION-METHOD]
UID: METHOD

APPROACH:
1. Read relevant manual chapters directly
2. Extract tables and specifications
3. Compare with LLVM implementation
4. Document discrepancies
5. Create fixes based on manual specifications

MANUAL_ACCESS:
- e200z4: https://www.elektronikjk.com/elementy_czynne/IC/E200Z4.pdf
- Need to extract from PDF sections manually

VALIDATION_OUTPUT:
- Extract to e200z4_validation_findings.sdoc
- Create discrepancy report
- Propose fixes for each discrepancy
- Update validation_results.sdoc with findings

